  "contentHtml": "<p>좀 부끄럽지만 지난 3년 간 출제했던 정기고사 원안 공유합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eb5245ad94e336c8c760344b10741151724c84a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eb5245ad94e336c8c760344b10741151724c84a\" data-origin-width=\"897\" data-origin-height=\"667\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e51173d1bad94870132374455293bb0ce690bf9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e51173d1bad94870132374455293bb0ce690bf9\" data-origin-width=\"557\" data-origin-height=\"682\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fd3897ae476f85fff2201fdd3b9b22010c60967\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fd3897ae476f85fff2201fdd3b9b22010c60967\" data-origin-width=\"323\" data-origin-height=\"586\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b068b2dce375386980096c5dbcd1df89c23a675\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b068b2dce375386980096c5dbcd1df89c23a675\" data-origin-width=\"322\" data-origin-height=\"552\"></div><p>이런 문제들이 있고요.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/000a2d96ea2fb15db2fb27b05539b2cdea5dd55a?download\" data-file-name=\"공유용 이미지.pptx\" data-file-size=\"8427045\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D923%26fileid%3D13%26regdt%3D20220218205543&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F000a2d96ea2fb15db2fb27b05539b2cdea5dd55a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">공유용 이미지</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">8.04MB</div></div></a></div><p>이 파일 열어보시면 제가 PPT로 편집했던 고사용 이미지들 쓰실 수 있어요. 중2 교과서 단원 순서로 넣어놨습니다.</p><p>제가 그린 것도 있지만 대부분은 교과서나 참고서 이미지 파일 기반으로 수정한 거예요.</p><p>틀 형식으로 되어 있는 것들 마음껏 수정하셔서 써주셔도 됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래는 원안 파일입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff360609ef60c19155339a58a074490e4494591f?download\" data-file-name=\"(2019 2-1 기말) 태양계, 열과 우리 생활.pdf\" data-file-size=\"469654\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D923%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20220218205543&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fff360609ef60c19155339a58a074490e4494591f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">(2019 2-1 기말) 태양계, 열과 우리 생활</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">458.65KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d71faa7b8a2bb0860ee6a6fd581ed5a2a0d32fe?download\" data-file-name=\"(2019 2-1 중간) 물질의 구성, 물질의 특성.pdf\" data-file-size=\"492338\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D923%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20220218205543&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F7d71faa7b8a2bb0860ee6a6fd581ed5a2a0d32fe')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">(2019 2-1 중간) 물질의 구성, 물질의 특성</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">4